* Kept so that strategies written before the version-2 naming keep working.
*
* This file is now just another name for autotrader-v2.afl. New strategies
* should include that instead -- the version number is the point, and this
* name says nothing about which version you are on.
*
*     #include <autotrader-v2.afl>
*
******************************************************************************/

